Z||000000||72vinman||08-01-2001||11:40 PM||||Curious, would a 3.3 engine from a 1992 grand am GT fit in a fiero? And would you be able to use the stock tranny.||||reg||5
Z||000001||mrfiero||08-01-2001||11:54 PM||||This has been mentioned before.....I had thought about it myself.  The problem is, it takes the same amount of mods to make the 3300 fit as it does to make the 3800 fit (they are essentially the same engine, one's just smaller displacement).  Therefore it "makes more sense" to instal a 3800 and take advantage of the extra displacemnt.<P>BTW.....I believe the Fiero tranny bolts up to it with no problems, but I'm not 100% positive.||||reg||1
